# "pagājušajā" (last, past) as the backward determiner: the locative
# definite form of the phrase Unicode CLDR 47 dateFields, locale lv, gives for
# relative-type--1 ("pagājušajā nedēļā", "pagājušajā gadā").  Only that form
# ships -- the participle has no dictionary declension table to transcribe, and
# the remaining cells would be guesses.
pagājušajā
